YieldcoinShare_rbacPolicy
├── mint and batchMint
│   ├── when the caller is not ParentVault
│   │   └── they should revert through the mint policy
│   └── when the caller is ParentVault
│       └── they should mint shares
├── burn and batchBurn
│   ├── when the caller is not ParentVault
│   │   └── they should revert through the burn policy
│   └── when the caller is ParentVault
│       └── they should burn shares
├── setCCIPAdmin
│   ├── when the caller is not config operator
│   │   └── it should revert through ACE
│   └── when the caller is config operator
│       └── it should set CCIP admin
├── metadata setters
│   ├── when the caller is not config operator
│   │   └── they should revert through ACE
│   └── when the caller is config operator
│       └── they should update token metadata
├── pause and unpause
│   ├── when the caller does not hold the configured role
│   │   └── they should revert through ACE
│   └── when the caller holds the configured role
│       └── they should update pause state
├── attachPolicyEngine
│   ├── when the caller is not policy engine manager
│   │   └── it should revert through ACE
│   └── when the caller is policy engine manager
│       └── it should attach the replacement engine
└── compliance operations
    ├── when the caller is not compliance operator
    │   └── single and batch calls should revert through the corresponding single-item policy
    └── when the caller is compliance operator
        └── single and batch calls should perform their configured operation
